            <div xml:id="d109">

                <pb facs="0110" n="101" sameAs="frus:frus1940v02/pg101"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">340.1115A/663: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Ireland</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Gray</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the
                            Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Dublin</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1940-05-22T13:00:00+01:00">May 22, 1940—1
                            p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received May 22—8:32 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>20. Consul’s preliminary estimate indicates probably less than 600 Americans in
                    Ireland desirous to return. No new arrivals.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Gray</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
